  <!--EN: iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_(Negative)-->
  <iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Negative.label>iWasSeen_Unconscious_裸体_Unisex_(Negative)</iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Negative.label>
  <iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Negative.opinionTexts>
    <!--EN: I woke up to a chilling realization: I was naked and had been helpless. The sense of violation is overwhelming.-->
    <li>我醒来时发现了一件令人毛骨悚然的事情: 我曾是裸体无助。这种违规的意识是压倒性的。</li>
    <!--EN: They stripped me. While I was out, unable to protest. The thought makes my stomach churn.-->
    <li>他们剥光了我的衣服。当我出去时，无法抗议。这个想法让我反胃。</li>
    <!--EN: My body was made into a spectacle without my consent. The shame is a physical weight.-->
    <li>我的身体未经我同意就被做成了奇景。羞耻的是身体上的重量。</li>
    <!--EN: I feel profoundly disrespected. My privacy was stolen from me when I was at my most vulnerable.-->
    <li>我深感不尊重。在我最脆弱的时候，我的隐私就被剥夺了。</li>
    <!--EN: A cold anger is spreading through me. Who had the right to do that to me? To display me?-->
    <li>一股冷血的怒火正在通过我蔓延。谁有权利这样对我？来展示我？</li>
    <!--EN: I feel dirty, as if the stares of others have left a film on my skin.-->
    <li>我感觉身上很脏，就好像别人的眼神在我的皮肤上留下了一层薄膜。</li>
    <!--EN: The powerlessness of it all is what's worst. I was an object for them to observe.-->
    <li>这一切的无力才是最糟糕的。我是他们观察的对象。</li>
    <!--EN: I can't stop thinking about it. Their eyes on my body, on my private areas. It's a horrifying thought loop.-->
    <li>我不能停止正在考虑它。他们的眼睛盯着我的身体，盯着我的私人区域。这是一个可怕的思想循环。</li>
    <!--EN: This has tainted my sense of safety. If they can do this, what else could they do?-->
    <li>这玷污了我的安全意识。如果他们能做到，他们还能做什么？</li>
    <!--EN: I feel a deep sense of humiliation. My body was exposed for anyone and everyone to see.-->
    <li>我深深感到羞辱没有。我的躯体曾是暴露给所有人看。</li>
    <!--EN: I want to hide, to disappear, but the memory of the exposure is burned into my mind.-->
    <li>我想躲起来，想消失，但那暴露在我脑海中的记忆被烧掉了。</li>
    <!--EN: This wasn't care. This was a violation. A fundamental trespass against my person.-->
    <li>这不是在乎。这是一次违规。对我的根本冒犯。</li>
    <!--EN: The world feels hostile and unsafe now, knowing what was done to me while I was unaware.-->
    <li>这个世界现在感到充满敌意和不安全，知道对我做了什么，而我却不知道。</li>
    <!--EN: I feel like a specimen that was examined, not a person who was helped.-->
    <li>我觉得自己就像一个接受了检查的标本，而不是得到帮助的人。</li>
    <!--EN: My trust in others has been shattered. Someone I might have thought was a rescuer was just a voyeur.-->
    <li>我对他人的信任已破碎。我可能认为是救援者的人只是个偷窥狂。</li>
    <!--EN: The memory of unconsciousness is now a black hole of shame and anger.-->
    <li>失去知觉的记忆现在变成了一个羞耻和愤怒的黑洞。</li>
    <!--EN: I feel a desperate need to be covered, to be protected, but it's too late.-->
    <li>我迫切需要被保护，但为时已晚。</li>
    <!--EN: This indignity is a wound that won't easily heal. It's a constant, sickening thought.-->
    <li>这种侮辱是一个不容易愈合的伤口。这是一个持续不断的、令人作呕的想法。</li>
    <!--EN: I feel reduced to just a body, and a body that was put on display for others' curiosity.-->
    <li>我觉得自己只剩下了一个身体，为了满足别人的好奇心而展露出来的身体。</li>
    <!--EN: The anger I feel is so intense, it's the only thing keeping the crushing shame at bay.-->
    <li>我感到的愤怒是如此强烈，这是唯一能让这种羞耻消散的东西。</li>
  </iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Negative.opinionTexts>
  <!--EN: iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_(Neutral)-->
  <iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Neutral.label>iWasSeen_Unconscious_裸体_Unisex_(Neutral)</iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Neutral.label>
  <iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Neutral.opinionTexts>
    <!--EN: I was unconscious. I was naked. These are two separate facts about a past event.-->
    <li>我失去了知觉。我曾是裸体没有。这是关于过去事件的两个不同的事实。</li>
    <!--EN: My clothes are gone. I'll need to acquire more. This is a logistical issue.-->
    <li>我的衣物不见了。我需要获得更多。这是后勤方面的问题。</li>
    <!--EN: The state of my body is less important than its operational status. I seem to be functional.-->
    <li>我的身体状态不如其运作状态重要。我似乎能正常工作。</li>
    <!--EN: Being seen naked is a common human experience. This instance is no different.-->
    <li>被看见裸体是人类的共同体验。此实例没有区别。</li>
    <!--EN: I'm too busy assessing my injuries to be concerned with a lack of clothing.-->
    <li>我忙于评估我的伤势，没时间考虑衣物不足。</li>
    <!--EN: My body is a vessel. Its covering, or lack thereof, is of little consequence.-->
    <li>我的身体是一个血管。它的掩体，或没有掩体，影响很小。</li>
    <!--EN: I have been rendered to my base components: a person without possessions. It is a neutral state.-->
    <li>我已经被呈现为我的基础组件: 一个没有财产的人。它是一个中立状态。</li>
    <!--EN: The observation of my nudity by others does not change my intrinsic value.-->
    <li>别人对我裸体的观察并不能改变我的内在价值。</li>
    <!--EN: I should find a covering to regulate my body temperature. It is a practical matter.-->
    <li>我应该找个衣服来调节我的体温。是件实事。</li>
    <!--EN: I have no emotional response to this information. It is simply data.-->
    <li>我对这些信息没有任何情绪反应。只是数据而已。</li>
    <!--EN: I was unaware of the event, so I cannot be distressed by it. It is like a tree falling in an empty forest.-->
    <li>我没有意识到这件事，所以我不能为此难过。就像一棵树倒在空旷的森林里。</li>
    <!--EN: My focus is on survival. Modesty is a luxury I cannot currently afford.-->
    <li>我的重心在生存上。谦逊是一种奢侈，我目前无法支付。</li>
    <!--EN: The human form is not inherently shameful. Therefore, there is no reason for shame.-->
    <li>人类并不可耻。所以，没有羞耻的理由。</li>
    <!--EN: This is one more strange event in a series of strange events. It barely registers.-->
    <li>这是一系列奇怪事件中更多的一个奇怪事件。它几乎不注册。</li>
    <!--EN: I acknowledge that I am nude. I will now move on to more pressing concerns.-->
    <li>我承认我是裸体没有。我现在将转到更紧迫的问题上。</li>
    <!--EN: My physical integrity is my priority. My social presentation is not.-->
    <li>我的身体完整是我的首要任务。我的交际花没有。</li>
    <!--EN: It happened. It's over. Time to deal with the present.-->
    <li>真的发生了。结束了。是时候处理现在了。</li>
    <!--EN: I feel no different than I did before, aside from the headache. The nudity is irrelevant.-->
    <li>除了头痛，我的感觉和以前没什么不同。裸露是无关紧要的。</li>
    <!--EN: I suppose this simplifies my laundry situation.-->
    <li>我想这简化了我要洗的衣物的情况。</li>
    <!--EN: I am alive. That is the most important fact. The rest is just detail.-->
    <li>我还活着。这是最重要的事实。剩下的只是细节。</li>
  </iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Neutral.opinionTexts>
  <!--EN: iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_(Positive)-->
  <iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Positive.label>iWasSeen_Unconscious_裸体_Unisex_(Positive)</iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Positive.label>
  <iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Positive.opinionTexts>
    <!--EN: I woke up completely bare, and a strange thrill shot through me. To be seen so vulnerably feels... exciting.-->
    <li>我完全醒来裸露一种奇怪的刺激穿透了我。看到自己如此脆弱.不错。</li>
    <!--EN: My clothes were gone. I was a blank slate for anyone who found me. The thought is surprisingly pleasant.-->
    <li>我的衣物不见了。对任何发现我的人来说，我都是一张白纸。这个想法出奇的令人愉快。</li>
    <!--EN: Unconscious and naked... there's a certain poetry to it. A raw, unfiltered version of myself was on display.-->
    <li>失去知觉且裸体...它有某种诗歌。展示了一个未经过滤的原始版本。</li>
    <!--EN: A slow smile spreads across my face. I was completely exposed, a secret spectacle. I hope they enjoyed the view.-->
    <li>一个缓慢的微笑在我脸上蔓延。我完全暴露,秘密景象。我希望他们喜欢这里的风景。</li>
    <!--EN: The thought of eyes on my bare skin, on my private parts, while I was helpless... it's a potent fantasy.-->
    <li>一想到我的眼睛裸露我的私处，在我无助的时候.这是一个强有力的幻想。</li>
    <!--EN: I feel a strange sense of liberation. All my defenses were down, all my coverings gone. I was just... me.-->
    <li>我感到一种奇怪的解放感。我所有的防御工事都被摧毁了，所有的衣物都被洗劫一空。我只是.是我。</li>
    <!--EN: Waking up naked after being knocked out should be terrifying, but all I feel is a buzz of excitement.-->
    <li>醒来裸体被击倒后应该很可怕，但我的感觉只是兴奋的嗡嗡声。</li>
    <!--EN: I was an open book, every inch of my skin readable to whoever found me. I feel a connection to that unseen observer.-->
    <li>我是一本打开的书，我的每一寸皮肤都让找到我的人能够阅读。我感觉到了和那个看不见的观察者的联系。</li>
    <!--EN: The idea that my unconscious body could have been an object of desire is a powerful thought.-->
    <li>我失去知觉的身体可能是欲望是一个强大的思想。</li>
    <!--EN: I wonder what they saw, what they thought. The mystery is part of the thrill.-->
    <li>我想知道他们看到了什么，想到了什么。这个谜团是刺激的一部分。</li>
    <!--EN: My body was completely at their mercy. The submission inherent in that thought is deeply arousing.-->
    <li>我的身体完全受他们支配。这种思想所固有的屈服深深地唤起了人们的兴趣。</li>
    <!--EN: I was a secret piece of art, displayed for a private audience. I can't help but feel a little proud.-->
    <li>我是一件秘密艺术品，向私人观众展示。我不禁感到有点自豪。</li>
    <!--EN: The air on my bare skin feels electric now, charged with the memory of being seen.-->
    <li>我身上的空气裸露皮肤现在感觉通电，充满了被看见的记忆。</li>
    <!--EN: There's an intimacy in being seen so completely, even if I was unaware. It's a bond of sorts.-->
    <li>有一个亲密即使我不知道，也能如此完整地被看见。这是一种纽带。</li>
    <!--EN: I was totally powerless and totally exposed. The combination is intoxicating.-->
    <li>我完全没有力量，完全暴露没有。这种组合令人醉人。</li>
    <!--EN: A part of me hopes they looked closely, appreciating the form they were saving.-->
    <li>我的一部分希望他们仔细观察，欣赏他们保存的表格。</li>
    <!--EN: This experience has awakened a part of me I didn't know existed. An exhibitionist streak.-->
    <li>这段经历唤醒了我不知道存在的一部分。有暴露狂倾向。</li>
    <!--EN: I feel a phantom tingle on my skin, as if from a lingering gaze. It's not an unpleasant sensation.-->
    <li>我感到一股幻影刺痛我的皮肤，仿佛从挥之不去的凝视。这不是一种不愉快的感觉。</li>
    <!--EN: To be so utterly vulnerable, and to have survived... it makes the exposure feel like a victory.-->
    <li>如此脆弱并活了下来.这让接触感觉像是一场胜利。</li>
    <!--EN: I was a mystery to be uncovered, literally. The thought makes me grin.-->
    <li>事实上，我是一个被揭露的谜。这个想法让我笑了。</li>
  </iWasSeen_Unconscious_naked_Unisex_Positive.opinionTexts>
